// route the corona, post-fx and Godray shaders took:
//     tools/assets/shaders/brn_suncorona.fx
//     (entries mainSunOcclusionVS / mainSunOcclusionPS / mainSunFlareVS /
//      mainSunFlarePS)
// Every ALU line in that .fx carries the instruction number of its counterpart in
// the disassembly (tools/assets/shaders/xenos.py; full annotated listing in
// scratch/coronas_step2/suncorona/work/DECODE.md).
//
// The constant surface is the CTAB interned in the console packages themselves
// (tools/assets/shaders/ctab.py) and the generator RE-CHECKS the recompiled CTAB
// against it name-for-name, register-for-register AND count-for-count:
//     occlusion vertex : (no constants)
//     occlusion pixel  : c0 kUvStartAndOffset   s0 SamplerSource   (sampler2D)
//     flare     vertex : (no constants)
//     flare     pixel  : c0 kColourAndPower     s0 OcclusionSource (sampler2D)
